IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ROUNDING.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-VAL PIC 9(2)V9(2).
01 WS-OUT PIC 9(2)V9(1).
01 WS-NEGIN PIC S9(2)V9(2).
01 WS-NEGOUT PIC S9(2)V9(1).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    MOVE 2.25 TO WS-VAL.
    COMPUTE WS-OUT ROUNDED = WS-VAL.
    DISPLAY WS-OUT.
    MOVE 2.35 TO WS-VAL.
    COMPUTE WS-OUT ROUNDED = WS-VAL.
    DISPLAY WS-OUT.
    MOVE 2.24 TO WS-VAL.
    COMPUTE WS-OUT = WS-VAL.
    DISPLAY WS-OUT.
    MOVE -2.25 TO WS-NEGIN.
    COMPUTE WS-NEGOUT ROUNDED = WS-NEGIN.
    DISPLAY WS-NEGOUT.
    STOP RUN.
